<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cullinan says plans to buy Midmacor.</title>
<headline>Cullinan says plans to buy Midmacor.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African industrial holdings firm Cullinan Holdings Ltd said on Monday that it was negotiating to buy unlisted Midmacor Industries Ltd.  </p>
<p>Cullinan said it planned a share issue to fund the acquisition of Midmacor, the business of which comprises principally the Cadoc outdoor products and the national Honda motorcycle and power products distrubutorship.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
